What a toolchain plugin declares beyond Kotlin source directories of the module is refused where
it is written, as is a plugin the project does not list, a plugin with settings or `pluginInfo`, a
directory a plugin task provides that is not there (krusty-toolchain runs no plugin task), a
directory of generated sources written directly rather than as a task's argument (which the
toolchain rejects too), and a source directory that exists without being a directory, for every
module the task needs.
--- task
:app:compileJvm
--- project.yaml
modules:
  - app
  - configured
  - file-root
  - missing
  - tools/direct
  - tools/elaborate
  - tools/named
  - tools/pregenerated
  - unlisted
plugins:
  - ./tools/direct
  - ./tools/elaborate
  - ./tools/named
  - ./tools/pregenerated
--- tools/pregenerated/module.yaml
product: jvm/amper-plugin
--- tools/pregenerated/plugin.yaml
tasks:
  declare:
    action: !org.example.build.declareSources
      sourceDir: ${module.rootDir}/generated-src/kotlin
generated:
  sources:
    - language: kotlin
      directory: ${tasks.declare.action.sourceDir}
--- tools/direct/module.yaml
product: jvm/amper-plugin
--- tools/direct/plugin.yaml
generated:
  sources:
    - language: kotlin
      directory: ${module.rootDir}/generated-src/kotlin
--- tools/elaborate/module.yaml
product: jvm/amper-plugin
--- tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml
tasks:
  produce:
    action: !org.example.build.produce
      outputDir: ${module.rootDir}/out
    markOutputsAs:
      - path: ${module.rootDir}/out
        kind: kotlin-sources
generated:
  sources:
    - language: java
      directory: ${module.rootDir}/java-gen
    - language: kotlin
      directory: gen
      fragment: main
  resources:
    - directory: ${module.rootDir}/res
commands: []
--- tools/named/module.yaml
product: jvm/amper-plugin
pluginInfo:
  id: renamed
--- tools/named/plugin.yaml
generated:
  sources:
    - language: kotlin
      directory: ${module.rootDir}/gen
--- app/module.yaml
product: jvm/app
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - ../unlisted
  - ../configured
  - ../missing
  - ../file-root
plugins:
  direct: enabled
  elaborate: enabled
  named: enabled
--- app/src/main.kt
fun main() = Unit
--- unlisted/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
plugins:
  elsewhere: enabled
--- unlisted/src/A.kt
class A
--- configured/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
plugins:
  pregenerated:
    enabled: true
    flavor: plain
--- configured/src/B.kt
class B
--- missing/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
plugins:
  pregenerated: enabled
--- missing/src/C.kt
class C
--- file-root/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
--- file-root/src
not a directory
--- krusty-refusal
error	configured/module.yaml:6:5: ERROR: krusty-toolchain reads plugin `pregenerated` of module `configured` only as `enabled` or `enabled: <boolean>`, without plugin settings
error	file-root/src: ERROR: Source directory at '<directory>/project/file-root/src' exists, but it's not a directory, this is currently unsupported
error	tools/pregenerated/plugin.yaml:8:18: ERROR: module `missing` needs the directory `<directory>/project/missing/generated-src/kotlin` that task `declare` of toolchain plugin `pregenerated` provides, and krusty-toolchain does not run plugin tasks
error	unlisted/module.yaml:5:3: ERROR: module `unlisted` enables toolchain plugin `elsewhere`, which the project does not list in its `plugins`
error	tools/direct/plugin.yaml:4:18: ERROR: the directory of generated sources of plugin `direct` must be an argument of one of its task actions, as the toolchain requires
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:5:5: ERROR: task `produce` of plugin `elaborate` sets `markOutputsAs`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement it
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:17:1: ERROR: plugin `elaborate` declares `commands`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement it
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:10:17: ERROR: plugin `elaborate` generates sources other than Kotlin sources, and krusty-toolchain compiles Kotlin sources only
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:11:18: ERROR: the directory of generated sources of plugin `elaborate` must be an argument of one of its task actions, as the toolchain requires
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:14:7: ERROR: plugin `elaborate` sets `fragment` on generated sources, and krusty-toolchain does not implement it
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:13:18: ERROR: the directory of generated sources of plugin `elaborate` must be an argument of one of its task actions, as the toolchain requires
error	tools/elaborate/plugin.yaml:15:3: ERROR: plugin `elaborate` declares `generated.resources`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement it
error	tools/named/module.yaml:2:1: ERROR: toolchain plugin `named` sets `pluginInfo`, and krusty-toolchain does not read it
